  "scientific_conclusion": [
    "A fixed nonlinear learner sees weak residual-mean information in the scalar, oriented 3x3x3, and coarser oriented 3x3x3 conditions, but no preregistered improvement rule passes simultaneously in all three domains.",
    "The best complete model reduces validation RMSE by only 0.31 to 0.35 percent at 1.25 Mpc/h and 0.68 to 1.03 percent at 2.5 Mpc/h relative to the frozen V33 linear reference.",
    "The V31 failure should therefore not be addressed by another deterministic conditional-mean backbone expansion. The next mechanism audit must decompose residual auto-power and backbone-residual cross-power and test whether conditional-copula translation destroys query-aligned phase coupling.",
    "The physically correct V33 sig_v channel remains available for the later CF4 interface, but neither sig_v nor local deterministic mean is currently the limiting mechanism."
